flowchart LR
    PreRouting["PRE_ROUTING<br/><b>does:</b> first IP-policy point after header validation<br/><b>why next:</b> routing must see any DNAT result<br/><b>typical work:</b> conntrack, defrag, DNAT"]
    Routing{"route lookup<br/><b>does:</b> decides local vs transit<br/><b>state:</b> dst->input chosen"}
    LocalIn["LOCAL_IN / INPUT<br/><b>does:</b> final policy for packets to this host<br/><b>why next:</b> accepted packets can reach sockets"]
    Forward["FORWARD<br/><b>does:</b> transit-only filtering after route lookup<br/><b>why next:</b> accepted packets continue to output path"]
    LocalOut["LOCAL_OUT / OUTPUT<br/><b>does:</b> policy for locally generated packets<br/><b>why next:</b> packet still needs final output routing/NAT"]
    PostRouting["POST_ROUTING<br/><b>does:</b> last policy/NAT point before TX<br/><b>why next:</b> accepted packets are ready for qdisc/dev queue<br/><b>typical work:</b> SNAT/masquerade"]

    Stack["local socket delivery<br/><b>state:</b> transport receives skb"]
    Tx["device output path<br/><b>state:</b> skb leaves IP stack"]

    PreRouting --> Routing
    Routing -->|destination is local| LocalIn --> Stack
    Routing -->|destination is elsewhere| Forward --> PostRouting --> Tx
    LocalOut --> PostRouting

